
# Input: ONE component for the author, the platform's own text field underneath (native-dom-0026). The build fills
# `{platform}` from its env chain, and every target reaches ./native/input.tree today, because an `input` element is
# already the platform's field on each: the browser's on the web, NSTextField, UITextField and EditText through the
# toolkit host. Takes `host`, `class`, `control` (the text, a signal) and `placeholder`.
# See note/term/app/11-uniform-interface.md.

bear @term/face/component/native/{platform}/input
